{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_2026052318423893083e2a0cd64e05","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_4bed1a5361cf4572903b058a","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"D:/loopcli/main/inbox/game-tester-mobile-report.md","content":"# Mobile Compatibility Test Report — 抖音小游戏\n\n> Date: 2026-05-23 | Agent: game-tester-mobile | Iteration: 46\n\n---\n\n## 1. 消消消大作战 (Match-3)\n\n### Test Results: 34/34 PASSED\n\n| Category | Tests | Status |\n|----------|-------|--------|\n| Touch Event Handling | 7/7 | PASS |\n| Canvas Resize Adaptation | 8/8 | PASS |\n| Douyin tt.* API Integration | 9/9 | PASS |\n| Viewport Configuration | 6/6 | PASS |\n| Input Coordinate Handling | 5/5 | PASS |\n\n### Key Findings\n\n**Touch Events (PASS)**\n- `InputHandler.js` binds `touchstart/touchmove/touchend` with `passive: false` and `preventDefault()` to prevent scroll interference\n- `active` flag properly disables board touch interception when navigation screens are showing\n- Navigation screens have dedicated `touchend` listener in `index.html` to handle menu clicks\n- Back-to-map button works via both `click` and `touchend` handlers\n- Swipe vs tap distinction uses 20% tile-size threshold — appropriate for mobile\n\n**Canvas Resize (PASS)**\n- `Renderer.resize()` handles `devicePixelRatio` for crisp high-DPI rendering\n- Canvas CSS dimensions use logical pixels; buffer dimensions use physical pixels\n- `window.resize` and `orientationchange` events both trigger `resize()`\n- `InputHandler.updateLayout()` is called on resize to keep touch coordinates in sync\n- Tile size dynamically calculated: `Math.floor(Math.min(w * 0.9, (h - 160)) / 8)` — adapts to any screen\n\n**Douyin API Integration (PASS)**\n- `AdManager` detects Douyin environment via `typeof tt !== 'undefined'`\n- Creates `tt.createRewardedVideoAd()` and `tt.createInterstitialAd()` with error/load/close handlers\n- Graceful fallback to Canvas-drawn stub ads for development\n- `SocialSystem` wraps `tt.shareAppMessage()` with try/catch fallback\n- `Analytics` uses `tt.request` with `fetch` fallback\n\n**Viewport (PASS)**\n- `user-scalable=no, maximum-scale=1.0` prevents accidental zoom\n- `touch-action: none` on canvas prevents browser gesture interference\n- `apple-mobile-web-app-capable` set for fullscreen on iOS\n\n### Previously Fixed Bugs (from iteration 45)\n1. Navigation screens non-responsive on touch — `InputHandler.prevent` was suppressing click events. Fixed by adding `active` flag and separate `touchend` handler.\n\n---\n\n## 2. 成语大闯关 (Idiom Master)\n\n### Test Results: 45/45 PASSED\n\n| Category | Tests | Status |\n|----------|-------|--------|\n| Touch Interaction Handling | 8/8 | PASS |\n| Text Input Adaptation | 5/5 | PASS |\n| Scroll List Touch Performance | 6/6 | PASS |\n| Screen Layout Responsiveness | 7/7 | PASS |\n| Douyin tt.* API Integration | 7/7 | PASS |\n| Game Logic Mobile Safety | 6/6 | PASS |\n| Mobile Runtime Compatibility | 6/6 | PASS |\n\n### Bugs Found and Fixed\n\n**Bug #1: `SocialManager.isDoujin` typo (CRITICAL)**\n- File: `src/js/SocialManager.js:88`\n- Issue: Property was `this.isDoujin` instead of `this.isDouyin`, causing friend leaderboard to always fall back to local data even in Douyin runtime\n- Fix: Changed `isDoujin` to `isDouyin`\n\n**Bug #2: `alert()` calls incompatible with Douyin runtime (HIGH)**\n- Files: `src/js/Game.js` (5 occurrences across `startLevel`, `useHintReveal`, `useHintRemove`, `skipQuestion`)\n- Issue: `alert()` may not work or may block execution in the Douyin mini-game runtime\n- Fix: Replaced all `alert()` calls with `_showToast()` — a custom DOM-based toast notification using a fixed-position div with auto-fade\n\n### Key Findings\n\n**Touch Interaction (PASS)**\n- Uses DOM rendering (HTML/CSS) — buttons get native touch support automatically\n- All buttons use `onclick` handlers which work on both click and touch\n- CSS `:active` states provide visual feedback on touch\n- `pointer-events: none` on used/removed candidates prevents accidental re-tap\n- Touch targets are adequate: candidate buttons 48x48px, slots 60x60px (minimum recommended is 44px)\n\n**Text Input Mobile Adaptation (PASS)**\n- Collection search input has `autocomplete=\"off\"`, `autocapitalize=\"none\"`, `enterkeyhint=\"search\"`\n- Uses `oninput` event for real-time filtering (responsive on mobile keyboards)\n- Focus state styled for visibility\n\n**Scroll Performance (PASS)**\n- All scrollable areas use `overflow-y: auto` with `-webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch`\n- Level grid, collection grid, character grid, daily content all properly scrollable\n- Collection uses CSS Grid for efficient layout\n- `max-width: 480px` centers on tablets while optimizing for phone screens\n\n**Layout (PASS)**\n- App container: `max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto` — phone-optimized\n- `overflow: hidden` prevents scroll bounce\n- Flexbox layout for all screens\n- Viewport meta: `user-scalable=no, maximum-scale=1.0`\n\n**Douyin API (PASS)**\n- `AdManager` detects Douyin, creates rewarded/interstitial ads via `tt.*` API\n- DOM-based stub ad overlay for development with proper z-index (10000)\n- `SocialManager` wraps `tt.shareAppMessage()` with fallback\n- `Analytics` flushes events via `tt.request`\n\n---\n\n## Summary\n\n| Game | Tests | Pass | Fail | Bugs Found | Bugs Fixed |\n|------|-------|------|------|------------|------------|\n| 消消消大作战 | 34 | 34 | 0 | 0 (new) | 0 (new) |\n| 成语大闯关 | 45 | 45 | 0 | 2 | 2 |\n| **Total** | **79** | **79** | **0** | **2** | **2** |\n\nBoth games are mobile-ready for Douyin mini-game deployment. The match3 game had all issues resolved in the prior iteration. The idiom game had two bugs found and fixed in this iteration: a typo breaking Douyin leaderboard integration, and `alert()` calls that are incompatible with the Douyin runtime.\n"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7463fb62-2e03-4edd-abad-466ff792dff1","uuid":"261a0eaa-62ce-4059-ac94-768b19307c3f"}
